<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPD TIME="4294967246">Even if that's the best possible end that person could wish for, would you still prevent it?
{WAIT "3000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
Someone precious loses something precious, loses the meaning of living, loses themselves.
{WAIT "3000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
And shuts themselves away in a world of their own, never able to come out again.
{WAIT "3000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
There are fates like that, too.
{WAIT "3000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry, at a time like this... </STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">when the one who wants to cry right now is </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE><BR>
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<STYLE ID="2">"The bond between sisters isn't something that can be cut, no matter what. </STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="2">No, even if it's about to be cut, I'll definitely protect it to the very end."</STYLE><BR>
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I was scared... </STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">of being thrown away―</STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">of not being needed, I was scared..."</STYLE><BR>
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESOFF "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\墓場夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"If </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is all right, then that's enough. </STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<STYLE ID="3">But if </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is hurting―"</STYLE><BR>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<STYLE ID="4">"You haven't changed."</STYLE><BR>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?"</STYLE><BR>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you haven't changed. </STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<STYLE ID="4">Ever since way back, and still now."</STYLE>
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{MESOFF "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "$000080" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱五島ナイフ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "32" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Be quiet!</STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<STYLE ID="5">　Or else...!"</STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Or else?"</STYLE><BR>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Your neck..."</STYLE><BR>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<STYLE ID="2">"My neck?"</STYLE><BR>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<STYLE ID="5">"............ </STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... </STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<STYLE ID="5">please understand."</STYLE>
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "32" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Sorry. I've already made up my mind..."</STYLE><BR>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\ラスト\五島フォーカス.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"I keep telling you I don't want this!"</STYLE><BR>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<STYLE ID="4">"I know! I don't want to be apart from you guys either!"</STYLE><BR>
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">...! I don't want to be apart from </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> either...!</STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<STYLE ID="6">　But... </STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<STYLE ID="6">no matter how close friends are... </STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<STYLE ID="6">a parting always comes someday..."</STYLE><BR>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, </STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, </STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
<STYLE ID="4">thanks for everything until now."</STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Goodbye..."</STYLE><BR>
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "NORMAL"}
{MESOFF "500"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
